Velocity compatibility layer. scripts/build-jar.ps1 merges them, with the Via
jars above, into conduit-<version>.jar, which keeps each jar's own license and
notice files under META-INF/licenses/<jar>/ and carries this file and LICENSE
under META-INF/conduit/. A first start writes both of those beside the jar, so
that a copy of Conduit that arrived as one file still comes with its terms; an
existing file of either name is never overwritten. The versions follow velocity-api's own POM, except night-config,
